@page "/help"

<PageTitle>Help Center & Guides — ReTrade</PageTitle>

<div class="page-head">
    <div>
        <h1>Help Center & Marketplace Guides</h1>
        <p class="muted">Everything you need to know about buying, selling, negotiating, and trading pre-owned items safely on ReTrade.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="contact">Contact Support</a>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="marketplace">Explore Marketplace</a>
    </div>
</div>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <a href="help#faq" class="detail-panel" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; border-top: 3px solid var(--brand);">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; color: var(--ink);">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0;">Quick answers to common questions about accounts, offers, and orders.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="help#buying-guide" class="detail-panel" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; color: var(--ink);">Buying Guide</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0;">Tips for inspecting item condition, negotiating prices, and safe handover.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="help#selling-guide" class="detail-panel" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; border-top: 3px solid #d97706;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; color: var(--ink);">Selling Guide</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0;">How to photograph your goods, write accurate descriptions, and handle trade offers.</p>
    </a>
</div>

<!-- Section: FAQs -->
<section id="faq" class="detail-panel" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; padding-bottom: 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem;">
        <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">How does item trading and swapping work on ReTrade?</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 0;">When a seller marks their listing as "Trade Available", any registered user can propose an exchange with one of their own active listings. The requester can also offer extra cash adjustment if the items differ in value. Both parties can negotiate counter-cash before accepting.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">How does price negotiation work?</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 0;">Listings marked as "Negotiable" allow buyers to make a price offer below the asking price. The seller can accept, decline, or send a counter-offer with an optional message directly through their User Dashboard.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">What payment methods are supported?</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 0;">ReTrade currently supports Cash on Delivery (COD) and direct in-person payment upon item inspection. This ensures buyers can inspect the physical condition of second-hand goods before completing payment.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">How do I report a fraudulent listing or inappropriate behavior?</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 0;">Every product listing has a "Report Listing" option where you can select a reason and provide details. Our moderation team reviews all reports in the Admin Moderation panel.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Section: Buying Guide -->
<section id="buying-guide" class="detail-panel" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; padding-bottom: 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);">Buying Guide</h2>
    
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem;">
        <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand);">1. Understand Item Conditions</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 0;"><strong>Like New:</strong> Barely used with original packaging or minimal signs of use.<br /><strong>Good:</strong> Fully functional with gentle cosmetic wear.<br /><strong>Fair:</strong> Functional with noticeable scratches or signs of aging.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand);">2. Check Seller Ratings</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 0;">Review feedback left by previous buyers on the seller's public profile page to understand their transaction history and reputation.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand);">3. Meet Safely & Inspect</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 0;">Whenever exchanging items locally, meet in public, well-lit spaces like community centers, malls, or daytime transit hubs. Test electronics before handing over funds.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Section: Selling Guide -->
<section id="selling-guide" class="detail-panel" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; padding-bottom: 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);">Selling Guide</h2>
    
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem;">
        <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent);">1. Clear Photography</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 0;">Upload well-lit photos showing the actual item from multiple angles. Clearly photograph any blemishes, scratches, or wear to build buyer trust.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent);">2. Accurate Pricing</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 0;">Research similar items in the marketplace. Set a fair asking price, and enable "Negotiable" or "Trade Available" if you want faster inquiries.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent);">3. Respond Promptly</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 0;">Check your User Dashboard regularly to review incoming offers and trade swaps. Responding quickly improves your seller rating and closes deals faster.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Section: Community Guidelines -->
<section id="community-guidelines" class="detail-panel">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-bottom: 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);">Community Guidelines</h2>
    <p class="muted">
        ReTrade is built on neighborly trust, transparent peer-to-peer exchange, and circular sustainability. We ask all members to treat one another with courtesy, accurately disclose item defects, and honor agreed meetup locations and prices.
    </p>
    <div style="margin-top: 1rem;">
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="terms">Read Terms & Conditions</a>
    </div>
</section>
